      ],
      "transcript": "[2:10] Altyum 365\n[2:10] PCB tasar\u0131m\u0131, MCAT veri y\u00f6netimi ve ekip \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 birle\u015ftiren elektronik \u00fcr\u00fcn tasar\u0131m platformudur.\n[2:17] Kurmak paya yap\u0131land\u0131rmak i\u00e7in ekstra bir \u00fccret ya da lisans alman\u0131za gerek yok."
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 15,
      "start_time": 140,
      "end_time": 150,
      "frames": [
        "frame_0043.jpg",
        "frame_0044.jpg",
        "frame_0045.jpg"
      ],
      "transcript": "[2:17] Kurmak paya yap\u0131land\u0131rmak i\u00e7in ekstra bir \u00fccret ya da lisans alman\u0131za gerek yok.\n[2:23] Altyum Designer i\u00e7inden direkt ba\u011flanabilirsiniz.\n[2:27] Ayr\u0131ca m\u00fc\u015fterileriniz ya da ekip arkada\u015flar\u0131n\u0131z internet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 ve internet taray\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 \u00fczerinden \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleyebilir ve bunlarla ilgili yorum ve de\u011ferlendirmelerde bulunabilir."
    },
