      "start_time": 150,
      "end_time": 160,
      "frames": [
        "frame_0046.jpg",
        "frame_0047.jpg",
        "frame_0048.jpg"
      ],
      "transcript": "[2:27] Ayr\u0131ca m\u00fc\u015fterileriniz ya da ekip arkada\u015flar\u0131n\u0131z internet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 ve internet taray\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 \u00fczerinden \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleyebilir ve bunlarla ilgili yorum ve de\u011ferlendirmelerde bulunabilir.\n[2:39] A\u00e7\u0131klamalar k\u0131sm\u0131nda bulunan linki kullanarak Altyum Designer yaz\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n \u00fccretsiz versiyonunu bilgisayar\u0131n\u0131za indirip kurarak denemeye hemen ba\u015flayabilirsiniz."
